VUE_APP_API_BASE_URL=/xiaozhi
#1.To make the web console adapt to mobile browsers, first start manager-api to get the server address (http://LAN-ip:8002/xiaozhi)
#2.In the .env of manager-mobile, change VITE_SERVER_BASEURL to your own server address, then run pnpm dev:h5 to get the h5 page address and fill it into VUE_APP_H5_URL below
#3.Then when a mobile browser visits the web page, it will be redirected to the h5 page adapted for mobile browsers
VUE_APP_H5_URL=